{"ticker":"CBRE","updated":"2026-11-27T22:42:54Z","profile":{"longName":"CBRE Group, Inc.","shortName":"CBRE Group Inc","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"Real Estate Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cbre.com","fullTimeEmployees":155000,"marketCap":40289837056,"trailingPE":29.93576,"forwardPE":15.73265,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.8951905,"pegRatio":16.18,"targetMeanPrice":170.25,"targetHighPrice":200.0,"targetLowPrice":141.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.127,"earningsGrowth":0.256,"grossMargins":0.18502001,"operatingMargins":0.02557,"profitMargins":0.03068,"totalRevenue":45006999552,"beta":1.227,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":174.27,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":121.44,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"CBRE Group, Inc. operates as a commercial real estate services and investment company in the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company operates through Advisory Services, Building Operations and Experience, Project Management, and Real Estate Investments segments. The Advisory Services segment offers strategic advice and execution to owners, investors, and occupiers of real estate in connection with leasing of offices, and industrial and retail space; clients fully integrated property sales services under the CBRE Capital Markets brand; clients commercial mortgage and structured financing services; originates and sells commercial mortgage loans; property management services, such as marketing, building engineering, lease administration, accounting, investment reporting services, financial services on a contractual basis for owners of and investors in office, industrial, and retail properties; and valuation services that include market value appraisals, litigation support, discounted cash flow analyses, and feasibility studies, as well as consulting services, such as property condition reports, hotel advisory, and environmental consulting. The Global Workplace Solutions segment provides facilities management, and project management services comprising building consulting, program, and project and cost management services under the Turner & Townsend bran","summary_zh":"世邦魏理仕集團 (CBRE Group, Inc.) 在美國、英國和國際上作為商業房地產服務和投資公司運作。該公司透過諮詢服務、建築運營和體驗、專案管理以及房地產投資部門進行運營。諮詢服務部門為房地產業主、投資者和租戶提供與辦公室、工業和零售空間租賃相關的策略建議和執行；客戶在世邦魏理仕資本市場品牌下全面整合房地產銷售服務；客戶商業抵押貸款和結構性融資服務；發放和銷售商業抵押貸款；物業管理服務，例如行銷、建築工程、租賃管理、會計、投資報告服務、為辦公室、工業和零售物業的業主和投資者提供的合約金融服務；估值服務，包括市場價值評估、訴訟支援、折現現金流量分析和可行性研究，以及諮詢服務，如房產狀況報告、酒店諮詢和環境諮詢。全球工作場所解決方案部門提供設施管理和專案管理服務，包括 Turner & Townsend 品牌下的建築諮詢、計劃以及專案和成本管理服務","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":158.68,"h":159.62,"l":157.58,"c":158.96,"v":1858700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":159.14,"h":159.16,"l":155.58,"c":157.56,"v":1625900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":157.45,"h":158.29,"l":155.7,"c":156.56,"v":1465600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":155.87,"h":155.87,"l":154.14,"c":155.63,"v":1311500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":156.42,"h":157.32,"l":155.6,"c":156.14,"v":947900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":156.56,"h":156.84,"l":152.8,"c":153.52,"v":1173300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":153.49,"h":154.02,"l":151.73,"c":152.69,"v":1008400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":151.79,"h":153.08,"l":150.06,"c":151.7,"v":1345400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":151.82,"h":153.18,"l":150.96,"c":152.46,"v":1166100},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":153.44,"h":153.99,"l":150.12,"c":150.38,"v":1179000},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":151.9,"h":153.68,"l":151.26,"c":152.93,"v":1069000},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":151.88,"h":154.85,"l":151.51,"c":154.36,"v":1224800},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":155.35,"h":157.6,"l":155.33,"c":156.82,"v":1508200},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":157.49,"h":157.79,"l":154.57,"c":155.42,"v":1030500},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":154.57,"h":157.32,"l":154.57,"c":157.12,"v":1155400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":157.64,"h":160.19,"l":156.93,"c":159.88,"v":1088800},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":159.7,"h":162.24,"l":159.16,"c":160.88,"v":1289700},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":161.45,"h":164.6,"l":160.76,"c":163.77,"v":326