 Arranges $45.6M Sale of Newly Constructed 97-Unit Luxury Multifamily Property in West New York New Jersey","src":"Yield PRO","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE54aW5HYW9MYmpWUzNBT3E0LXk5WUh4dGE5RWZrUGhfbjV1NDRpWkJWV0V4Y3dlUlRLT3kyYTQxU251Znl1NkZNT0tGNGxPcF9scXNQOTNVcVU?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"世邦魏理仕 (CBRE) 安排以 4,560 萬美元出售位於新澤西州紐約西部新建的 97 套豪華多戶住宅物業"},{"title":"CBRE Group (CBRE) Sees Deal Volume Jump As Undervalued Narrative Holds","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQeTc0R01WU0FpUm5jU0pYaFY0WUhQZ2VsLWlENC1tY1ViQVlPeGc3cGJUUjZBU1p4WXRVQi1lYURiMnBDUnlVa0JwWnczSmN3b1RoVUFWNVlfaVJIdzIyb2U3SE1aaExFU1pYbU5sOFNUMlNYdjhJeUdiWGhhVTIyY1RVMXdKaExQZTNYTkdyRjU?oc=5","date":"2026-11-13","zh":"世邦魏理仕集團 (CBRE) 認為交易量因被低估的說法而激增"},{"title":"MetLife Grows Again at Namesake Manhattan Building","src":"The Real Deal","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQNGwzWDhMXzlXNkJKZVJnWGViRnNFMjl6LW9JTEt5SlB5RlR1b3gwVFk5X1I4T0tGOW5SaTEyeGs5WTkyZ0dFWTB4M1pPNEpSa1ZnVkVDRTVqQjg4S3Q3b3dXd3ZWMm9ISGlKeFd1RV91UWhBUDNTeGYzcDVhVmpONElwbUp5RlV2MWV1V3RDRk05M0VaMkdPYVJpRQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"大都會人壽在同名曼哈頓大廈再次發展壯大"}],"themes":[{"name":"資料中心","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1138118/000113811826000005/cbre-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CBRE is the world's largest commercial real estate services and investments firm (based on 2025 revenue). We derive competitive advantage from our considerable scale and ability to offer integrated solutions for real estate investors and occupiers in more than 100 countries. We are global market leaders in most of our business lines and drive significant growth by helping clients optimize real estate costs, value, investment returns and workplace experiences. These capabilities, combined with our extensive knowledge platform (research, data, strategy, etc.), allow us to generate superior outcomes for our clients, which included nearly 90% of Fortune 100 companies and many of the world's largest institutional real estate investors in 2025.","zh":"世邦魏理仕是全球最大的商業房地產服務和投資公司（基於 2025 年收入）。我們的競爭優勢來自於我們為 100 多個國家的房地產投資者和租戶提供綜合解決方案的規模和能力。我們在大多數業務領域都是全球市場領導者，並透過幫助客戶優化房地產成本、價值、投資回報和工作場所體驗來推動顯著成長。這些能力與我們廣泛的知識平台（研究、數據、策略等）相結合，使我們能夠為客戶創造卓越的成果，其中包括 2025 年近 90% 的財富 100 強公司和許多全球最大的機構房地產投資者。"},{"en":"Our growth opportunity is enhanced by the large and expanding total addressable market for our services. We are focused on cementing our leadership position in each of our businesses with a strategy that achieves growth across four dimensions of our business: geographies, clients, property types and services. We are committed to deploying our resources and capital in parts of our business that benefit from secular tailwinds and/or are cyclically resilient across these four dimensions. Examples of how we have expanded our participation in secularly favored and resilient businesses and enlarged our total addressable market include our acquisitions of:","zh":"我們服務的龐大且不斷擴大的總目標市場增強了我們的成長機會。我們專注於鞏固我們在每項業務中的領導地位，制定策略，在業務的四個維度上實現成長：地理、客戶、物業類型和服務。我們致力於將我們的資源和資本部署到受益於長期順風和/或在這四個維度上具有週期性彈性的部分業務。我們如何擴大對長期受青睞和有彈性的業務的參與並擴大我們的總潛在市場的例子包括我們的收購："},{"en":"J&J Worldwide Services (now doing business as CBRE Government & Defense Services), which markedly increased the facilities-related services we provide to the U.S. federal government;","zh":"J&J Worldwide Services（現以 CBRE Government & Defense Services 名義開展業務），顯著增加了我們向美國聯邦政府提供的設施相關服務；"}],"markets":[{"en":"We serve clients and report our financial results through four business segments: Advisory Services, Building Operations & Experience, Project Management and Real Estate Investments. We also report results for a Corporate and other segment, which encompasses our platform and non-core investments.","zh":"我們透過四個業務部門為客戶提供服務並報告我們的財務表現：諮詢服務、建築營運和體驗、專案管理和房地產投資。我們也報告企業和其他部門的業績，其中包括我們的平台和非核心投資。"},{"en":"Advisory Services provides a comprehensive range of services globally, including leasing, capital markets (property sales and mortgage origination), loan servicing, and valuation. With a global network of experts that have a deep understanding of their local markets, we offer comprehensive insights and solutions across a wide range of assets, including offices, industrial and logistics, retail, multi-family and critical facilities, such as data centers, laboratories, and government facilities. Our client base is comprised of large occupiers and investors that contract for our services across multi-market portfolios as well as local market clients that we serve on a one-off basis.","zh":"諮詢服務在全球範圍內提供全面的服務，包括租賃、資本市場（房地產銷售和抵押貸款發放）、貸款服務和估值。憑藉對當地市場有深入了解的全球專家網路，我們為各種資產提供全面的見解和解決方案，包括辦公室、工業和物流、零售、多戶住宅和關鍵設施，例如資料中心、實驗室和政府設施。我們的客戶群包括在多市場投資組合中簽訂服務合約的大型租戶和投資者，以及我們一次性服務的本地市場客戶。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Building Operations Experience","val":23224000000,"zh":"建構營運經驗"},{"name":"Advisory Services","val":8840000000,"zh":"諮詢服務部門"},{"name":"Project Management","val":7657000000,"zh":"專案管理部門"},{"name":"Real Estate Investments","val":879000000,"zh":"房地產投資部門"}],"total":40550000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Facilities Management","val":20645000000,"zh":"設施管理"},{"name":"Project Management","val":7657000000,"zh":"專案管理"},{"name":"Advisory Leasing","val":4497000000,"zh":"諮詢租賃"},{"name":"Property Management","val":2529000000,"zh":"物業管理"},{"name":"Advisory Sales","val":2120000000,"zh":"諮詢銷售"},{"name":"Valuation","val":815000000,"zh":"估價"},{"name":"Investment Management Property Management Brokerage & Other Professional Services","val":602000000,"zh":"投資管理 物業管理 經紀及其他專業服務"},{"name":"Bank Servicing","val":357000000,"zh":"銀行服務"},{"name":"Other Portfolio Services","val":354000000,"zh":"其他組合服務"},{"name":"Real Estate Development Services","val":266000000,"zh":"房地產開發服務"}],"total":40550000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":22848000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"All Other Countries","val":11993000000,"zh":"所有其他國家"},{"name":"GB","val":5709000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":40550000000}},"peers":["JLL","ALLE","FTV","IQV","REG"]}}